# Frontend Conventions

- Use Vue 3 Composition API and `<script setup>`.
- Keep page-level state in `src/App.vue`; put reusable state and API behavior in composables.
- Components receive props and emit events. They must not call `apiFetch()` directly or import site JSON.
- Use `PascalCase.vue` for components and `useX.js` for composables.
- Route all API calls through `src/api/client.js`; preserve automatic JWT handling.
- Business data belongs to the backend. Only documented auth and theme keys may use localStorage; do not restore `nav_pinned`.
- Do not add router, Pinia/Vuex, axios, UI frameworks, CSS preprocessors, or TypeScript without explicit approval.
